            "text": "theorem exists_sigma {h j : ℝ} {P : ℝ → ℝ}\n    (p : SmallParameters h j) (pP : PressureData P) :\n    ∃ σ : ℝ, 0 < σ ∧ ∀ η ∈ Icc (-1 : ℝ) 1,\n      |Z h j P η| ≤ j / 10 → 99 / 100 < chi h j σ η"
